Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.67,0:00:08.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（伯克斯威尔 一年前）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.10,0:03:48.20,Title,0,0,0,0,,《邪恶力量》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.54,0:00:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在你们离开之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}And before you leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.15,0:00:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个苹果派 免费赠送\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of our apple pies. On the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.27,0:00:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天啊 太感谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.20,0:00:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 不用谢 - 我们应该多迷几次路\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're welcome. - Hey, we should get lost more often.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.22,0:00:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是说这镇子上的人太善良了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, everyone in this town is so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.09,0:00:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 看看你手上拿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, what's the catch?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.95,0:00:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 全都准备好了 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're all set. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.56,0:00:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}纹身很酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a cool tattoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.72,0:00:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.11,0:00:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在给你指条上州际公路的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's get you back to the interstate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.33,0:00:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}麻烦你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.64,0:00:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从这小路直接出镇子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take Lasky straight out of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.24,0:00:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后在果园小路右转\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then turn right on Orchard Road.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.84,0:00:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.07,0:01:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.50,0:01:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.34,0:01:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}车子挂掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Car just died.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.30,0:01:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}手机也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cell phone too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.02,0:01:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么可能？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.46,0:01:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过来吧 那边好象有房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Looks like a house over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.78,0:01:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我才不过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not going in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.29,0:01:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的 我们需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holly, we need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.60,0:01:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不能一直等在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't just wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.92,0:01:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.22,0:02:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.22,0:02:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「如果我们有大脑」\N{\fnArial\fs30}lf I only had a brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.73,0:02:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们就不会迷路 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wouldn't be lost. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.02,0:02:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我见过最他妈畸形的稻草人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That has got to be the freakiest damn scarecrow I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.48,0:02:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吓着我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It scares me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.08,0:02:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拜托 快点离开 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, let's just hurry, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.35,0:02:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你听见了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.25,0:02:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喂 谁在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.24,0:03:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}文森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vince?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.89,0:03:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}文森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vince?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.77,0:03:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩。-\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.42,0:04:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喂 萨姆 是你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Sam, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.64,0:04:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸 你受伤了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad. Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.92,0:04:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.30,0:04:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们到处找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been looking for you everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.14,0:04:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不知道你在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't know where you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.04,0:04:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也不知道你是否还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you were okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.03,0:04:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, l'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.00,0:04:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你和迪恩呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you and Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.66,0:04:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们都还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.67,0:04:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸 你在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.52,0:04:33.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉孩子 我还不能告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, kiddo, I can't tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.90,0:04:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.83,0:04:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么不能？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.84,0:04:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是爸爸吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}ls that Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.42,0:04:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 我知道你很难理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know this is hard for you to understand. You just.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.28,0:04:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你只要相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have to trust me on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.28,0:04:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在追踪它 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're after it, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.80,0:04:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杀害妈妈的凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing that killed Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.11,0:04:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 是个恶魔 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. It's a demon, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.00,0:04:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恶魔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.16,0:04:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你确定？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know for sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.53,0:04:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恶魔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.91,0:04:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.16,0:04:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.54,0:05:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Sammy, l, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.98,0:05:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也知道发生在你女朋友身上的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I also know what happened to your girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.79,0:05:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.31,0:05:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经尽力让你躲避它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would've done anything to protect you from that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.60,0:05:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道它在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know where it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.64,0:05:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我已经最终接近它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I think I'm finally closing in on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.13,0:05:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我们来帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.03,0:05:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.45,0:05:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们不能参与进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't be any part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.06,0:05:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.19,0:05:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把电话给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.16,0:05:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 萨姆 这就是我打电话来的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Sammy, that's why l'm calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.44,0:05:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你和你哥哥得停止找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and your brother, you gotta stop looking for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.13,0:05:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要你记下这些名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I need you to write down these names.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.48,0:05:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Names?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.98,0:05:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么名字 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}What names?Dad, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.23,0:05:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.08,0:05:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我这到底是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.57,0:05:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们没时间讨论这个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we don't have time for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.55,0:05:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这比你想的要麻烦得很多 它们无处不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is bigger than you think. They're everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.96,0:05:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就算是现在我们现在说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even us talking right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.24,0:05:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.56,0:05:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.40,0:05:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}绝对不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.21,0:05:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把电话给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.22,0:05:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在我命令你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've given you an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.82,0:05:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}停止找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you stop following me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.22,0:05:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}做你该做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you do your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.41,0:05:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.23,0:05:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在记下这些名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, take down these names.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.39,0:05:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸 是我 你在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, it's me. Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.31,0:06:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.89,0:06:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我拿到笔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I got a pen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.45,0:06:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are the names?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.74,0:06:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 爸爸给的这些名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so the names Dad gave us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.15,0:06:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}全是夫妇的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all couples?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.42,0:06:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}三对不同的夫妇都失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three different couples, all went missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.51,0:06:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们在不同的州不同的小镇上失踪的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}From different towns, different states?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.89,0:06:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 华盛顿 纽约 科罗拉多\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right, yeah. Washington, New York, Colorado.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.76,0:06:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每对夫妇都是在乡村公路旅行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each couple took a road trip cross-country.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.57,0:06:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有一对是到达目的地的\N{\fnArial\fs30}None arrived at their destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.92,0:06:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也再没有他们的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}or were ever heard from again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.73,0:06:35.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}乡村是很大的 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a big country.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.67,0:06:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们可能在任何地方失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}They could've disappeared anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.04,0:06:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could've.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.86,0:06:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是所有的路线都把他们送到印地安那的同一个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}But each one's route took them through the same part of Indiana.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.20,0:06:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且都是在四月的第二个星期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always on the second week of April.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.45,0:06:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一年接一年再接一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}One year after another after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.71,0:06:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在就是四月的第二个星期\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the second week of April.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.24,0:06:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正解 所以爸爸就叫我们去印地安那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.So Dad is sending us to lndiana…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.61,0:06:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在下一对夫妇消失之前把那家伙给干掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}to go hunting for something before another couple vanishes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.84,0:06:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}猜对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yahtzee.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.40,0:06:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能想象一下把这些全部整理起来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you imagine putting together a pattern like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.02,0:07:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸参加了所有这些葬礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The different obits Dad had to go through?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.26,0:07:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是牧师\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man's a master.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.31,0:07:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.97,0:07:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们不去印地安那\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not going to Indiana.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.04,0:07:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.73,0:07:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不去 我们要加利福尼亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we're going to California.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.91,0:07:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸是从公用电话打来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad called from a pay phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.72,0:07:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是萨克拉曼多的区号 （加州首府）\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a Sacramento area code.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.11,0:07:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.22,0:07:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 如果爸爸现在接近的是 杀死妈妈和杰西的凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, if this demon killed Mom and Jess, and Dad's closing in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.85,0:07:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们就该去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.00,0:07:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们该去帮爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.31,0:07:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸不需要我们的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad doesn't want our help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.60,0:07:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.89,0:07:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他给我们下达了命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has given us an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.61,0:07:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.70,0:07:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们不要总是对他惟命是从\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't always have to do what he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.15,0:07:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 爸爸叫我们做本职工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, Dad is asking us to work jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.16,0:07:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拯救生命 那才是最重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}to save lives. It's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.72,0:07:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 我能理解 相信我 我能理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I understand. Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.56,0:07:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是我只是说耽误一个星期 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}But l'm talking one week here, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.56,0:07:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找到答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}To get answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.12,0:07:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后报仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}To get revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.93,0:07:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 我明白你的感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, look, I know how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.30,0:07:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你明白？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.78,0:07:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}妈妈死的时候你多大\N{\fnArial\fs30}How old were you when Mom died?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.48,0:07:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}四岁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.29,0:07:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}六个星期前杰西才去世\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jess died six months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.54,0:08:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么可能明白我的感受？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell would you know how I feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.94,0:08:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸说那对我们来说太危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad said it wasn't safe for any of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.30,0:08:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就算他知道些我们不知道的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}He obviously knows something that we don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.39,0:08:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他叫我们靠边站 我们就得靠边站\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he says stay away, we stay away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.42,0:08:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我实在不能理解你对他的盲目崇拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand the blind faith you have in the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.14,0:08:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你甚至对他没有任何疑问\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's like you don't even question him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.63,0:08:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至少这叫做孝顺的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's called being a good son.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.70,0:08:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是个自私的杂种\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a selfish bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.79,0:08:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.61,0:08:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你总是任性妄为\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just do whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.64,0:08:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}根本不在乎其他人怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't care what anybody thinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.98,0:08:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真的是这么认为的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you really think?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.74,0:08:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.19,0:08:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 自私的杂种要去加利福尼亚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then this selfish bastard is going to California.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.94,0:08:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 够了 你不是认真的吧 - 我手是认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, you're not serious. - I am serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.12,0:08:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在是半夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the middle of the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.59,0:08:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 我要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm taking off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.50,0:08:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要把你扔在这里 听见了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will leave your ass, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.36,0:08:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就想你这么干\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I want you to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.57,0:09:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那再见吧 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.38,0:10:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我猜猜 Scotty？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess. Scotty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.67,0:10:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.44,0:10:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我叫约翰·巴纳姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, my name's John Bonham.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.40,0:10:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}齐柏林飞船鼓手？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that the drummer for Led Zeppelin?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.69,0:10:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.35,0:10:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}摇滚狂热者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Classic rock fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.40,0:10:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能帮你做点什么吗 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I do for you, John?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.30,0:10:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想知道你是否可能见过这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was wondering if, uh, you've seen these people, by chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.13,0:10:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 他们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope. Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.95,0:10:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friends of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.11,0:10:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们大约一年前失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}They went missing about a year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.22,0:10:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们好象路过这附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}They passed through somewhere here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.77,0:10:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经去过斯科特斯勃格和塞伦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked around Scottsburg and Salem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.81,0:11:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉 这里不常有外地人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. We don't get many strangers around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.56,0:11:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}斯科蒂 如果你笑一笑就会照亮整个屋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scotty, you got a smile that lights up a room.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.30,0:11:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人告诉过你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody ever tell you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.51,0:11:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.70,0:11:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}待会儿见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.44,0:11:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.18,0:11:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你把我吓死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You scared the hell out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.23,0:11:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉 我只是想你是否需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I just thought you might need some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.81,0:11:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很好 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, I'm good, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.83,0:11:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, so where you headed?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.97,0:11:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无意冒犯 但是我不想告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No offense, but no way l'm telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.94,0:11:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.13,0:12:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可能是个精神病\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could be some kind of freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.43,0:12:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的意思你是个搭便车的\N{\fnArial\fs30}l mean, you are hitchhiking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.19,0:12:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, so are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.52,0:12:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要搭车吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need a ride?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.79,0:12:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是的 - 是的 只带她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, yeah. - Yeah. Just her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.68,0:12:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不会带你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I aingt taking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.88,0:12:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你相信一个可疑的货车男也不相信我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You trust shady van guy and not me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.71,0:12:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.04,0:12:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你确定他们没有停下来加油或其他什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure they didn't stop for gas or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.63,0:12:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 不记得有他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope, don't remember them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.95,0:12:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说他们是你的朋友？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say they were friends of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.50,0:12:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 没错 - 那人身上有纹身吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's right. - Did the guy have a tattoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.83,0:12:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.62,0:12:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还记得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.76,0:13:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们才刚刚结婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were just married.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.40,0:13:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是对的 他们来加过油\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. They did stop for gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.28,0:13:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}停留不超过10分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weren't here more than 1 0 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.60,0:13:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还记得什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.60,0:13:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我告诉他们怎么回州际公路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told them how to get to the interstate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.64,0:13:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后他们就离开镇子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They left town.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.82,0:13:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能给我指一下路吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you point me in that direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.34,0:13:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.56,0:13:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.49,0:14:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伙计 你可真郁闷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, you fugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.64,0:15:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}干得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice tat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.55,0:15:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你又回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.47,0:15:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}根本就没走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never left.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.38,0:15:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还在找你的朋友？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still looking for your friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.32,0:15:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不介意帮我装满好吗 艾米丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind filling it up there, Emily?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.12,0:16:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在这里长大的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So did you grow up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.30,0:16:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我13岁的时候到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Came here when I was 1 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.16,0:16:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我失去了父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.64,0:16:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}车祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}A car accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.00,0:16:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我姑妈和伯父抚养我长大\N{\fnArial\fs30}My aunt and uncle took me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.66,0:16:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是善良的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're nice people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.83,0:16:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里每个人都很善良\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody's nice here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.01,0:16:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那这个小镇就很完美了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, it's the, uh, perfect little town?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.77,0:16:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然远离市区 但我喜欢这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know, it's the boonies, but I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.02,0:16:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们周围的那些镇子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the towns around us…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.12,0:16:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人们失去房子 农场\N{\fnArial\fs30}people are losing their homes, their farms.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.08,0:16:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.31,0:16:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像受到祝福一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's almost like we're blessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.15,0:16:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你去过郊外的果园吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you been out to the orchard?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.88,0:16:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}见过那个稻草人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seen that That scarecrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.80,0:16:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 把我吓跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it creeps me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.84,0:16:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 那是谁的？- 不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whose is it? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.18,0:16:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一直都在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just always been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.94,0:16:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是你姑妈伯父的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That your aunt and uncle's?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.63,0:16:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}顾客的 车子有些小问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Customer. Had some car troubles.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.01,0:16:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是两个人 是不是一男一女？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a couple, is it? A guy and a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.62,0:17:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉 到萨克拉曼多的车明天才会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, the Sacramento bus doesn't run again till tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.99,0:17:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下午5 05\N{\fnArial\fs30}5:05 p.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.48,0:17:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}明天？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.32,0:17:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}应该还有其他办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gotta be another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.68,0:17:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有啊 买辆车吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there is. Buy a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.40,0:17:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.04,0:17:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.46,0:17:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又见到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.17,0:17:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的顺风车怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to your ride?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.19,0:17:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.68,0:17:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那家伙是很可疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}That guy was shady.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.51,0:17:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}毛手毛脚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was all hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.53,0:17:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我把他甩掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cut him loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.40,0:17:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.66,0:17:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想办法去加利福尼亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just trying to get to California.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.92,0:17:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.26,0:17:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.31,0:18:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下一班车要明天才来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, next bus isn't until tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.77,0:18:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.96,0:18:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是麻烦所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.41,0:18:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.39,0:18:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}加利福尼亚有什么东西这么重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's in Cali that's so important?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.35,0:18:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是我一直在寻找的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just something I've been looking for for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.90,0:18:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我肯定再等一天也没关系 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then l'm sure it can wait one more day, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是梅格 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Meg. Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.32,0:18:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们这里以苹果闻名\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're famous for our apples.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.42,0:18:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以你们应该尝尝这馅饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you gotta try this pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.08,0:18:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不用了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.16,0:18:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没关系 免费赠送\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope, it's on the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.00,0:18:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你好斯科蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiya, Scotty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.64,0:18:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给我来杯咖啡好吗 黑咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I get a coffee, black?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.12,0:18:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还来份那种馅饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and some of that pie too, while you're at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.36,0:18:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你好 路过的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing? Just passing through?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.69,0:18:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公路旅行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Road trip. Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.88,0:18:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.59,0:19:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想他们想安静的吃饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure these people wanna eat in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.21,0:19:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是友好的交谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a little friendly conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.80,0:19:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也要那咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and that coffee too, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.31,0:19:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.22,0:19:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们怎么来到这镇子的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what brings you to town?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.96,0:19:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}停下来给车子加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just stopped for gas…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.15,0:19:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}加油站的人救了我们的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, uh, the guy at the gas station saved our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.05,0:19:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是这样的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}ls that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.12,0:19:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 车子的刹车油泄漏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. One of our brake lines was leaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.17,0:19:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们却没发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.26,0:19:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他正在帮我们修理\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's fixing it for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.77,0:19:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.92,0:19:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是啊 - 你们什么时候上路？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - So how long until you up and running?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.82,0:19:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 日落的时候 - 真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sundown. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.32,0:19:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}修理刹车\N{\fnArial\fs30}To fix a brake line?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.98,0:19:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗯 我对修车也略知一二\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I know a thing or two about cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.14,0:19:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以免费为你们修车 让你们在一个小时之后就能上路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have you running in an hour. Wouldn't charge you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.91,0:19:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}十分感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.29,0:19:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是我更愿意让一个专业技工来做\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I think we'd rather have a mechanic do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.38,0:19:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.52,0:19:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道这段路\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it's just that these roads, um.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.09,0:19:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚上不太安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not real safe at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.24,0:20:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.77,0:20:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道这听起来很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it sounds strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.77,0:20:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是你们可能会很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh, you might be in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.71,0:20:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我们好好吃饭 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're trying to eat, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.40,0:20:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.49,0:20:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我弟弟一定会展示他那张纯洁幼稚的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, my brother could give you this puppy-dog look…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.98,0:20:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后你们就会相信他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you'd just buy right into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.31,0:20:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}感谢你的到来 治安官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for coming, sheriff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.63,0:20:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想和你谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a word, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.28,0:20:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}够了 我今天已经够倒霉的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. I'm having a bad day already.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.27,0:20:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你肯定不想变得更倒霉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to make it worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.26,0:21:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你现在是在休假还是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, are you on some kind of vacation or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.25,0:21:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.87,0:21:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像是游泳池边散步一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all sipping Cristal poolside for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.83,0:21:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是这样的 我不得不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I had to…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.60,0:21:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}离家出走\N{\fnArial\fs30}get away from my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.88,0:21:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.06,0:21:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我爱我的父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love my parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.63,0:21:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们也想把最好的给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they wanted what's best for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.66,0:21:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是他们并知道我想要的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}They just didn't care if I wanted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.85,0:21:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们觉得我应该聪明一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was supposed to be smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.57,0:21:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但并不是聪明得吓跑了丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not smart enough to scare away a husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.34,0:21:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这只是… 因为我家人是这样说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. It's just…because my family said so…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.40,0:21:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我应该乖乖地坐着 做他吩咐我做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm supposed to sit there and do what I was told.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.84,0:21:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我就离家出走\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I just went on my own way instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.17,0:21:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起 说了让你难以理解的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}m sorry. The things you say to people you hardly know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.99,0:21:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.61,0:21:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我明白你的感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.88,0:22:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还记得之前我提到的哥哥？跟我一起旅行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember that brother I mentioned before, that I was road tripping with?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.73,0:22:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟你的情况类似\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, uh It's kind of the same deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.57,0:22:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以你就不跟他一起旅行了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you're not riding with him anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.68,0:22:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}祝我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.07,0:22:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}食物可能很糟糕 床可能会很硬\N{\fnArial\fs30}The food might be bad and the beds might be hard…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.38,0:22:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是至少我们活在自己的生活中 没有其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but at least we're living our own lives…and nobody else's.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.57,0:22:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.99,0:22:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们才修了车\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just got the car fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.08,0:22:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.32,0:22:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}斯蒂夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steve.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.64,0:23:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.63,0:23:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回到车上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back to your car.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.25,0:23:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快走 走啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.13,0:23:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跑啊 跑啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.78,0:23:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.61,0:23:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这到底是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.05,0:23:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.55,0:24:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}稻草人爬下了架子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The scarecrow climbed off its cross?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.39,0:24:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我告诉你 伯克斯威尔是个有趣的镇子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you. burkitsville, lndiana. Fun town.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.08,0:24:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它没杀掉那对夫妇吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It didn't kill the couple, did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.09,0:24:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 没你我处理不好这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I can cope without you, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.91,0:24:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}肯定有什么赋予它生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}So something must be animating it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.77,0:24:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}幽灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}A spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.67,0:24:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不仅仅是幽灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's more than a spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.88,0:24:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是神 异教邪神\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a god. A pagan god, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.39,0:24:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么那样说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.99,0:24:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}猎杀是每年一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}The annual cycle of its killings.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.98,0:24:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且受害者总是一男一女\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the victims are always a man and a woman…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.83,0:24:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像某种盛大的祭祀\N{\fnArial\fs30}like some kind of fertility rite.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.87,0:24:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你应该去看看那些当地居民\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you should see the locals.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.75,0:24:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们对待那对夫妇的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way they treated this couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.09,0:24:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像圣诞火鸡一样把他们喂肥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fattening them up like a Christmas turkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.55,0:24:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最后的晚餐 给那些献祭的受害者\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last meal. Given to sacrificial victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.18,0:24:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想那些祭品都是献给同一个异教神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, l'm thinking a ritual sacrifice to appease some pagan god.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.38,0:24:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以神就支配了稻草人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So a god possesses the scarecrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.81,0:24:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}稻草人拿走了它的祭品\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the scarecrow takes its sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.56,0:24:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第二年农作物就没落叶病 也不会蔓延开\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for another year, the crops won't wilt and disease won't spread.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.45,0:24:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道对付的是什么神？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know which god you're dealing with?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.19,0:24:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 还不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.54,0:24:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道它是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Figure out what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.63,0:24:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你就知道该怎么干掉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can figure out a way to kill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.12,0:24:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道 我已经在去当地社区学院的路上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I'm actually on my way to a local community college.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.38,0:25:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经给一个教授约好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got an appointment with a professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.04,0:25:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为已经没有忠实的傻瓜伙计 帮我做这些研究了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, since I don't have my trusty sidekick geek boy to do all the research.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.62,0:25:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你在暗示需要帮助 你就直说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, if you're hinting you need my help, just ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.77,0:25:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没暗示任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not hinting anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.71,0:25:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事实上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.93,0:25:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想让你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to know…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.84,0:25:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我并不是那么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, don't think…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.16,0:25:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道 我也很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. l'm sorry too.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.76,0:25:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, you were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.94,0:25:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你应该做你自己的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta do your own thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.61,0:25:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要为自己而活\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta live your own life.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.70,0:25:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你认真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.54,0:25:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你总是能知道自己需要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've always known what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.31,0:25:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后就去追逐它\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you go after it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.25,0:25:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你勇敢的抵抗爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stand up to Dad…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.56,0:25:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是说你总是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you always have.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.81,0:25:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}该死 我希望我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, I wish l.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.02,0:25:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.74,0:26:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很佩服那样的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}l admire that about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.65,0:26:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我为你而感到骄傲 Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm proud of you, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.99,0:26:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道该说什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even know what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.36,0:26:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说你会照顾好自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say you'll take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.37,0:26:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.12,0:26:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找到爸爸给我打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call me when you find Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.61,0:26:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 再见迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Bye, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.22,0:26:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.38,0:26:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.73,0:26:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.69,0:26:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「再见」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.76,0:27:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并不是每天都有人来问关于邪神崇拜的研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not every day I get a research question on pagan idolatry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.59,0:27:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 这只是业余爱好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, call it a hobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.22,0:27:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说你只是对本地传说感兴趣？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you said you were interested in local lore?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.23,0:27:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想印地安那并是不因为异教崇拜而出名吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid Indiana isn't really known for its pagan worship.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.60,0:27:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果它是外来的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if it was imported?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.90,0:27:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像一些流浪者把他们的信仰到处传播\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the Pilgrims brought their religion over.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.09,0:27:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里大部分地方不都是由移民开发的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't this area settled by immigrants?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.98,0:27:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就像这附近的小镇伯克斯威尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like that town near here, Burkitsville.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.96,0:27:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们的祖先来自什么地方？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are their ancestors from?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.33,0:27:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想是北欧 斯堪的纳维亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Northern Europe, I believe. Scandinavia.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.55,0:27:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你给我说说那些异教神\N{\fnArial\fs30}What could you tell me about those pagan gods?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.73,0:27:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}斯堪的纳维亚有几百个神和女神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there are hundreds of Norse gods and goddesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.38,0:27:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事实上我只在找一个 可能就住在果园\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm actually looking for one. Might live in an orchard.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.27,0:27:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}森林之神\N{\fnArial\fs30}A woods god.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.76,0:27:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.73,0:27:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.78,0:27:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.17,0:27:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个本质上可不是森林之神\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not a woods god, per se.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.17,0:27:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莞讷神？（北欧神话中的神族）\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Vanir?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.61,0:27:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莞讷神是北欧的保护和繁荣之神\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The Vanir were Norse gods of protection and prosperity…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.41,0:27:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「保护当地安全免受伤害」\N{\fnArial\fs30}keeping the local settlements safe from harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.23,0:28:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「村民在地里建造莞讷神的雕像」\N{\fnArial\fs30}The villages built effigies of the Vanir in their fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.53,0:28:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「其他村民寻找活人祭品」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other villages practiced human sacrifice."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.76,0:28:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「一名男性和一名女性」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"One male and one female"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.47,0:28:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这看起来像是稻草人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of looks like a scarecrow, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.50,0:28:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.42,0:28:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「这种特别的莞讷神的能量来源于神木」\N{\fnArial\fs30}This particular Vanir, its energy sprung from a sacred tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.43,0:28:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}异教徒认为所有的东西都被注入了魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, pagans believed all sorts of things were infused with magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.78,0:28:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果神木被烧掉会怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what would happen if the sacred tree was torched?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.17,0:28:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你认为这会杀了神吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think it'd kill the god?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.45,0:28:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}孩子 我们只是在讨论传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son…these are just legends we're discussing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.49,0:28:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.47,0:28:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.59,0:28:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}十分感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.56,0:28:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很荣幸帮到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad I could help. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.75,0:29:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你一定得明白 Hurley\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do understand, Harley?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.98,0:29:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里的每个人都有责任保护镇子\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of us here, it's It's our responsibility to protect the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.10,0:29:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.94,0:29:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比你们都明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better than all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.80,0:29:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是我给他们指路的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the one that gives them directions.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.56,0:29:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是我把他们送到果园的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the one that sends them down to the orchard.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.74,0:29:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赫尔利 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harley, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.69,0:29:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们都关上了门\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all close our doors…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.91,0:29:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把头撇向一边 让我们听不到尖叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}look the other way…pretend we can't hear the screams.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.85,0:29:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这次不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.64,0:29:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这次是谋杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.22,0:29:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它对我们发怒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's angry with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.72,0:29:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}树已经开始死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Already the trees are beginning to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.76,0:29:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今晚是第七个晚上了 我们最后的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight's the seventh night of the cycle. Our last chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.28,0:29:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果那孩子该死 那就让他死\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the boy has to die, the boy has to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.01,0:29:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但为什么要这样对她？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why does it have to be her?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.68,0:30:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}斯泰西姑妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aunt Stacey.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.35,0:30:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赫尔利伯父 求求你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle Harley, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.95,0:30:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们为什么要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.25,0:30:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了共有的神\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the common good.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.45,0:30:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}班车来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Our bus came in.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.29,0:30:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你最好上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better catch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.95,0:30:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}l gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.55,0:30:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go where?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.72,0:30:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伯克斯威尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burkitsville.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.47,0:30:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.87,0:31:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}连续三个小时 我都在给我哥哥打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been calling my brother for the last three hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.59,0:31:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只能收到他的语音邮件\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm getting his voicemail.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.20,0:31:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能他已经关机了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe his phone's turned off.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.84,0:31:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 那不是他的作风\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's not like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.64,0:31:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}梅格 我想他遇上麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meg, I think he might be in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.95,0:31:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.10,0:31:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在我不能解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}l can't really explain right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.83,0:31:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.49,0:31:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可不想你错过班车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want you to miss your bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.01,0:31:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.42,0:31:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要回到你哥哥身边？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're running back to your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.58,0:31:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是你尽力要摆脱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy you ran away from?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.93,0:31:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么 就因为他没接电话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Because he won't pick up his phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.56,0:31:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 来吧 跟我一起去加利福尼亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam. Come. With me to California.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.35,0:31:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不能 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't. l'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.63,0:31:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.82,0:31:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他是我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.11,0:31:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.36,0:31:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们要杀了我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna kill us?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.50,0:32:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拿我们当祭品 我也不清楚 我想是很盛大的那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sacrifice us. Which is, I don't know, classier, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.23,0:32:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真的一点也不了解 是不是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really didn't know anything about this, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.59,0:32:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}了解什么 稻草人之神？\N{\fnArial\fs30}out what? The scarecrow god?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.30,0:32:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.02,0:32:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你最好开始相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you better start believing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.71,0:32:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because l'm gonna need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.68,0:32:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.64,0:32:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们可以毁掉那个稻草人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we can destroy the scarecrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.33,0:32:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是我们得先找到那棵树\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we gotta find the tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.68,0:32:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么树\N{\fnArial\fs30}What tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.09,0:32:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许你可以帮我找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you can help me with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.17,0:32:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}肯定足够古老\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be really old.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.53,0:32:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且当地人对它表现出敬意\N{\fnArial\fs30}The locals would treat it with a lot of respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.53,0:32:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为它是神圣的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, like it was sacred.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.67,0:32:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有一棵苹果树\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was this one apple tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.06,0:32:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是移民们带来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The immigrants brought it over with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.16,0:32:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们叫它「初树」\N{\fnArial\fs30}They call it the First Tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.98,0:32:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在果园里吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}ls it in the orchard?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.29,0:32:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 但是我不知道确切位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but I don't know where.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.84,0:33:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.10,0:33:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你杀了多少人 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many people have you killed, sheriff?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.52,0:33:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你双手沾满了多少鲜血\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much blood is on your hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.07,0:33:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们没杀他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.62,0:33:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是你却掩盖了真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but you sure cover up after.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.04,0:33:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你藏了多少辆车 烧掉了多少件衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, how many cars have you hidden, clothes have you buried?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.70,0:33:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赫尔利伯父 求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uncle Harley, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.03,0:33:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很抱歉 Emily\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so sorry, Em.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.12,0:33:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也希望那不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish it wasn't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.72,0:33:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽力理解吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.29,0:33:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我们的职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.29,0:33:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's just no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.34,0:33:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别无他人 只有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nobody else but you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.49,0:33:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是你的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.49,0:33:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetheart…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.83,0:33:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这才是「牺牲」的真谛\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's what sacrifice means.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.47,0:34:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了伟大的神而放弃你的最爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Giving up something you love for the greater good.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.43,0:34:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}镇子需要解救\N{\fnArial\fs30}The town needs to be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.99,0:34:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}牺牲小我而完成大我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The good of the many outweighs the good of the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.84,0:34:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让你的苹果派去见鬼吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope your apple pie is freaking worth it!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.89,0:34:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的计划呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.24,0:34:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm working on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.97,0:34:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你根本就没计划 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have a plan, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.04,0:34:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm working on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.45,0:34:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能看到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.47,0:34:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 什么 - 它开始动了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - ls he moving yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.71,0:34:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't see.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.43,0:35:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.64,0:35:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.05,0:35:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.71,0:35:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我收回之前说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take everything back I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.60,0:35:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看到你真是太高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so happy to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.35,0:35:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.44,0:35:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么到这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.53,0:35:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我偷了一辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh, stole a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.29,0:35:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这才是我兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.39,0:35:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}盯着那个稻草人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep an eye on that scarecrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.45,0:35:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它随时可能复活\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could come alive any minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.11,0:35:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么稻草人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What scarecrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.00,0:35:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 现在是你说的那个神木\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Now, this sacred tree you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.64,0:35:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是它的能量之源\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the source of its power.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.71,0:35:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找到它然后烧掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's burn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.91,0:35:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早上的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.77,0:35:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在它皮革脸咬到屁股之前 我们得快一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just shag ass before Leatherface catches up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.81,0:35:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.93,0:36:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}求求你们 让我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please let us go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.33,0:36:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会很快结束的 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be over quickly, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.40,0:36:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.41,0:36:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}艾米丽 你得让他跟你一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emily, you have to let him take you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.24,0:36:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.71,0:37:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.18,0:37:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}整个镇子都会消逝\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the whole town's gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.24,0:37:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.87,0:38:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你认为她没事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think she's gonna be all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.50,0:38:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.86,0:38:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}剩下的那些镇民 他们会离开吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the rest of the townspeople, they'll just get away with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.49,0:38:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}镇子的将来已经足够做为惩罚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What will happen to the town will have to be punishment enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.69,0:38:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以把你扔在某地吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So can I drop you off somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.41,0:39:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不能 我想你离不开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I think you're stuck with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.95,0:39:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么让你改变主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}What made you change your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.35,0:39:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 我还是想找到爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't. I still wanna find Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.24,0:39:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且你也是个讨厌鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're still a pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.44,0:39:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是杰西和妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Jess and Mom…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.33,0:39:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她们都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're both gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.15,0:39:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鬼才知道爸爸在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad is God knows where.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.80,0:39:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.52,0:39:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都是家里仅存的\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're all that's left.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.31,0:39:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我们能看穿这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, if we're gonna see this through…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.06,0:39:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就能一起来干\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're gonna do it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.56,0:39:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拥抱一下 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold me, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.17,0:39:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说得太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was beautiful. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.49,0:39:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}行了吧 你应该亲我屁屁表示感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be kissing my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.26,0:39:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不然你就死定了 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were dead meat, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.57,0:39:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.54,0:39:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当时我已经有个计划怎么逃脱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a plan. I'd have gotten out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.44,0:39:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.81,0:40:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}到哪儿 美女\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where to, pretty lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.93,0:40:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把车子开到路边好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you pull over?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.87,0:40:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.14,0:40:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}照办\N{\fnArial\fs30}That works.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.73,0:40:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.41,0:40:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要进行通话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got to make a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.89,0:40:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可以用我的手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}l got a cell you can use.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.67,0:40:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是你所谓的通话\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not that kind of call.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.91,0:41:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你的顺风车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for the ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.71,0:41:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}[咒语]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[SPEAKING IN LATIN]
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.26,0:41:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这完全没意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}It makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.04,0:41:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以阻止Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have stopped Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.95,0:41:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}该死 我可以把他们都带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, I could've taken them both.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.73,0:41:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么让他们离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why let them go?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.36,0:41:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.28,0:41:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.99,0:41:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遵命 父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Father.
